  "rules": [
    "Keep drug, medical care, spiritual foundation, radio signal and biological measurement separate.",
    "Do not infer a diagnosis from a symptom or a technical signal.",
    "Traditional use does not by itself establish treatment safety or effectiveness.",
    "Preserve original words, language, script, units, sources and uncertainty.",
    "Machine drafts require qualified review before patient-facing or clinical use.",
    "Never equate spiritual language with medical evidence.",
